<title>USA: First Southern Q3 loss after SAIF charge.</title>
<headline>First Southern Q3 loss after SAIF charge.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Ala. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					  September 30    September 30,</p>
<p> Key operating data		 1995    1996     1995    1996</p>
<p> Total interest income	   $3,539 $3,843  $10,046 $11,240</p>
<p> Total interest expense	   1,675  1,924    4,875   5,616</p>
<p> Net interest income		1,864  1,919    5,171   5,624</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	  154     60	413     210</p>
<p>Net interest income after</p>
<p>  provision for loan losses     1,710  1,859    4,758   5,414</p>
<p> Non interest income		  121    152	316     231</p>
<p> Non interest expense		 991  2,242    2,816   5,374</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	 840  (231)    2,258     271</p>
<p> Income tax expense (benefit)     303  (156)	814    (75)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		    537   (75)    1,444     346</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share	 0.28 (0.04)	N/A    0.18</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 third quarter and nine month results include</p>
<p>$1.09 million SAIF assessment charge.</p>
<p>1995 nine month share income not available because company</p>
<p>did not complete initial public offering until April 1995.</p>
<p>Full name is First Southern Bancshares Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
